  11:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_bus.h ****       A delay between an RCC peripheral clock enable and the effective peripheral
  12:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_bus.h ****       enabling should be taken into account in order to manage the peripheral read/write
