 112:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal.c ****               ##### Initialization and Configuration functions #####
 113:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal.c ****  ===============================================================================
 114:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal.c ****     [..]  This section provides functions allowing to:
 115:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal.c ****       (+) Initializes the Flash interface the NVIC allocation and initial clock 
 116:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal.c ****           configuration. It initializes the systick also when timeout is needed 
 117:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal.c ****           and the backup domain when enabled.
 118:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal.c ****       (+) De-Initializes common part of the HAL.
 119:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal.c ****       (+) Configure the time base source to have 1ms time base with a dedicated 
 120:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal.c ****           Tick interrupt priority. 
 121:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal.c ****         (++) SysTick timer is used by default as source of time base, but user
 122:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal.c ****              can eventually implement his proper time base source (a general purpose 
 123:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal.c ****              timer for example or other time source), keeping in mind that Time base 
 124:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal.c ****              duration should be kept 1ms since PPP_TIMEOUT_VALUEs are defined and 
 125:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal.c ****              handled in milliseconds basis.
ARM GAS  /tmp/ccLYcsI2.s 			page 225


 126:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal.c ****         (++) Time base configuration function (HAL_InitTick ()) is called automatically 
 127:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal.c ****              at the beginning of the program after reset by HAL_Init() or at any time 
 128:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal.c ****              when clock is configured, by HAL_RCC_ClockConfig(). 
 129:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal.c ****         (++) Source of time base is configured  to generate interrupts at regular 
 130:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal.c ****              time intervals. Care must be taken if HAL_Delay() is called from a 
 131:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal.c ****              peripheral ISR process, the Tick interrupt line must have higher priority 
 132:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal.c ****             (numerically lower) than the peripheral interrupt. Otherwise the caller 
 133:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal.c ****             ISR process will be blocked. 
 134:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal.c ****        (++) functions affecting time base configurations are declared as __weak  
 135:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal.c ****              to make  override possible  in case of other  implementations in user file.
 136:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal.c **** @endverbatim
 137:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal.c ****   * @{
