 267:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_i2c.c ****      keep and use the user MspInit/MspDeInit callbacks (registered beforehand) whatever the state.
