 959:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_i2c.c ****     (#) There are two modes of transfer:
 960:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_i2c.c ****        (++) Blocking mode : The communication is performed in the polling mode.
