1469:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_usart.h ****   * @note   Other remaining configurations items related to Asynchronous Mode
1470:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32f4xx_ll_usart.h ****   *         (as Baud Rate, Word length, Parity, ...) should be set using
