 349:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/targets/taranis/lcd_driver_spi.cpp ****   /*
 350:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/targets/taranis/lcd_driver_spi.cpp ****   LCD Sleep mode is also good for draining capacitors and enables us
