   4:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc.c ****   * @author  MCD Application Team
   5:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc.c ****   * @brief   RCC HAL module driver.
   6:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc.c ****   *          This file provides firmware functions to manage the following
   7:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc.c ****   *          functionalities of the Reset and Clock Control (RCC) peripheral:
   8:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc.c ****   *           + Initialization and de-initialization functions
