  10:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc.c ****   *
  11:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc.c ****   @verbatim
  12:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc.c ****   ==============================================================================
  13:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc.c ****                       ##### RCC specific features #####
  14:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc.c ****   ==============================================================================
  15:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc.c ****     [..]
  16:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc.c ****       After reset the device is running from Internal High Speed oscillator
  17:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc.c ****       (HSI 16MHz) with Flash 0 wait state, Flash prefetch buffer, D-Cache
  18:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc.c ****       and I-Cache are disabled, and all peripherals are off except internal
  19:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc.c ****       SRAM, Flash and JTAG.
  20:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc.c ****       (+) There is no prescaler on High speed (AHB) and Low speed (APB) busses;
  21:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc.c ****           all peripherals mapped on these busses are running at HSI speed.
  22:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc.c ****       (+) The clock for all peripherals is switched off, except the SRAM and FLASH.
  23:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc.c ****       (+) All GPIOs are in input floating state, except the JTAG pins which
  24:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc.c ****           are assigned to be used for debug purpose.
  25:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc.c **** 
  26:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc.c ****     [..]
  27:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc.c ****       Once the device started from reset, the user application has to:
  28:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc.c ****       (+) Configure the clock source to be used to drive the System clock
  29:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc.c ****           (if the application needs higher frequency/performance)
  30:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc.c ****       (+) Configure the System clock frequency and Flash settings
  31:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc.c ****       (+) Configure the AHB and APB busses prescalers
  32:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc.c ****       (+) Enable the clock for the peripheral(s) to be used
  33:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc.c ****       (+) Configure the clock source(s) for peripherals which clocks are not
  34:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc.c ****           derived from the System clock (I2S, RTC, ADC, USB OTG FS/SDIO/RNG)
  35:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc.c **** 
  36:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc.c ****                       ##### RCC Limitations #####
  37:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc.c ****   ==============================================================================
  38:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc.c ****     [..]
  39:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc.c ****       A delay between an RCC peripheral clock enable and the effective peripheral
  40:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc.c ****       enabling should be taken into account in order to manage the peripheral read/write
  41:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc.c ****       from/to registers.
  42:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc.c ****       (+) This delay depends on the peripheral mapping.
  43:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc.c ****       (+) If peripheral is mapped on AHB: the delay is 2 AHB clock cycle
  44:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc.c ****           after the clock enable bit is set on the hardware register
  45:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc.c ****       (+) If peripheral is mapped on APB: the delay is 2 APB clock cycle
  46:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc.c ****           after the clock enable bit is set on the hardware register
  47:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc.c **** 
  48:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc.c ****     [..]
  49:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc.c ****       Implemented Workaround:
  50:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc.c ****       (+) For AHB & APB peripherals, a dummy read to the peripheral register has been
  51:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc.c ****           inserted in each __HAL_RCC_PPP_CLK_ENABLE() macro.
  52:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc.c **** 
  53:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc.c ****   @endverbatim
  54:/workspaces/edgetx-sw/radio/src/thirdparty/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rcc.c ****   ******************************************************************************
